  <SequenceName>k__BackingField: 1-2B
  lines:
  - speaker: 2
    text: "Quite the fiesta in there, wasn\u2019t it?"
  - speaker: 2
    text: Or maybe it was closer to a warzone.
  - speaker: 2
    text: I enjoyed it, all the running and ducking? It was exciting!
  - speaker: 2
    text: "Even if my clothes got messed up, I\u2019m sure my parents would understand."
  - speaker: 2
    text: "In fact, I think they\u2019d be pretty happy to see that I found a friend!"
  - speaker: 2
    text: "I\u2019m sure yours would be glad too!"
  - speaker: 2
    text: Right?
